        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Facinelli, Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont, Michael Corrente\n- Films: Twilight film adaptations, Can't Hardly Wait, Loosies, Love Is Not a Crime, Pick Pocket\n- Roles: Dr. Carlisle Cullen, Mike Dexter\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, Can't Hardly Wait was released as an American teen comedy film written and directed by Deborah Kaplan and Harry Elfont.\n- In 1998, Peter Facinelli played Mike Dexter in the film Can't Hardly Wait.\n- Peter Facinelli played Dr. Carlisle Cullen in the film adaptations of the Twilight novel series.\n- In 2012, Loosies was released as a romantic comedy-drama film directed by Michael Corrente.\n- In 2012, Peter Facinelli wrote and produced Loosies.\n- Loosies was also known as Love Is Not a Crime and Pick Pocket.",
